---
import StatusLayout from '@/layouts/StatusLayout.astro'
---

<StatusLayout
  title="Proximo despliegue"
  description="CODE29 prepara su proxima evolucion. La siguiente fase del ecosistema se desplegara pronto."
>
  <section class="coming-soon">
    <div class="coming-soon__visual status-panel">
      <span class="status-eyebrow">System uptime: 99.98%</span>
      <div class="coming-soon__visual-copy">
        <p class="status-mono">Code29 synapse</p>
        <h1>PROXIMO_DESPLIEGUE</h1>
        <p>
          Arquitectando la proxima evolucion de la inteligencia empresarial con una capa visual
          mas precisa, automatizacion y operaciones AI-first.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="coming-soon__content status-panel">
      <p class="status-mono coming-soon__kicker">Initialize_protocol_29</p>
      <h2>La red CODE29 se expandira pronto</h2>
      <p class="coming-soon__lead">
        Estamos preparando el siguiente despliegue del ecosistema CODE29. Si quieres recibir
        prioridad cuando activemos el acceso, usa el enlace directo y te contactaremos de forma
        personalizada.
      </p>

      <div class="coming-soon__countdown" aria-hidden="true">
        <div>
          <strong>14</strong>
          <span>Days</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>08</strong>
          <span>Hours</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>42</strong>
          <span>Mins</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>19</strong>
          <span>Secs</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="coming-soon__form-block">
        <label class="status-mono" for="coming-soon-email">Ingresar email para notificacion</label>
        <div class="status-field">
          <span>&gt;</span>
          <input
            id="coming-soon-email"
            type="email"
            placeholder="user@architect.os"
            aria-describedby="coming-soon-help"
          />
        </div>
        <p id="coming-soon-help">
          Acceso anticipado disponible por contacto directo mientras se activa el canal de
          notificaciones.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="coming-soon__actions">
        <a class="status-link status-link--primary" href="/#contact">Solicitar acceso</a>
        <a class="status-link status-link--secondary" href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
      </div>

      <dl class="coming-soon__meta">
        <div>
          <dt>Core authority</dt>
          <dd>Lvl 9 network admin encryption</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Current lat</dt>
          <dd>40.4168 N / 3.7038 W</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</StatusLayout>

<style>
  .coming-soon {
    max-width: 88rem;
    min-height: calc(100dvh - 11.5rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(22rem, 1fr);
    gap: 0.125rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .coming-soon__visual,
  .coming-soon__content {
    min-height: 100%;
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .coming-soon__visual {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19, 19, 20, 0.2), rgba(19, 19, 20, 0.88)),
      radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.28), transparent 35%),
      radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.22), transparent 30%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(28, 27, 28, 0.95), rgba(14, 14, 15, 0.95));
  }

  .coming-soon__visual::before,
  .coming-soon__visual::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto auto 12% 10%;
    width: 16rem;
    height: 16rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35), transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(229, 226, 227, 0.08), transparent);
    transform: skew(-14deg);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .coming-soon__visual::after {
    inset: 10% 8% auto auto;
    width: 20rem;
    height: 20rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.25), transparent 48%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.06), transparent);
  }

  .coming-soon__visual-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  .coming-soon__visual-copy p:first-child,
  .coming-soon__kicker,
  .coming-soon__countdown span,
  .coming-soon__form-block label,
  .coming-soon__meta dt {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
  }

  .coming-soon__visual-copy h1,
  .coming-soon__content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .coming-soon__visual-copy h1 {
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 var(--space-4);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.94;
    color: var(--color-primary-dim);
  }

  .coming-soon__visual-copy p:last-child,
  .coming-soon__lead,
  .coming-soon__form-block p,
  .coming-soon__meta dd {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .coming-soon__content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .coming-soon__content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .coming-soon__lead {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .coming-soon__countdown {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .coming-soon__countdown div {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: rgba(19, 19, 20, 0.48);
  }

  .coming-soon__countdown strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-primary-dim);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .coming-soon__form-block {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .coming-soon__form-block label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  .coming-soon__form-block span {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .coming-soon__form-block p {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .coming-soon__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .coming-soon__meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  .coming-soon__meta div {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: rgba(19, 19, 20, 0.42);
  }

  .coming-soon__meta dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .coming-soon {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .coming-soon__visual {
      min-height: 22rem;
    }

    .coming-soon__countdown,
    .coming-soon__meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
